    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ae5c06752ac48.85562596\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has released some statistics about the WoW: Forever Beta, and over 8 million characters were created!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/overview-features-zones-raids\" data-icon-only=\"true\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"></a></div><br><br>The WoW: Forever Beta is now over and launch is less than a week away. Blizzard has now released some interesting stats from the WoW: Forever, including the massive number of characters created and total PvP kills. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"markup-bluetweet exclude-units\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/wowheadtweets/status/2116245690200342529\">Tweet #2116245690200342529</a></div></div><br><br>The stats include:<ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Characters Created: 8,862,354</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Deadliest Dungeon: The Hall of Thanes</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">PvP Kills: 9,959,014</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Skyborne: 1,889,084</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Deadliest Creature: Kobold Miner</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Duels Fought: 1,248,125</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Forsaken Paladins: 612,096</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Deaths from Falling: 1,157,204</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Zone with the Most PvP: Hillsbrad Foothills</div></li></ul>Are you ready for WoW: Forever on November 4th? Check out <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/overview-features-zones-raids\" data-contiguous=\"true\">all our guides</a> to prepare.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has released some statistics about the WoW: Forever Beta, and over 8 million characters were created!<br /><br />The WoW: Forever Beta is now over and launch is less than a week away. Blizzard has now released some interesting stats from the WoW: Forever, including the massive number of characters created and total PvP kills. <br /><br />The stats include:<br /><ul><li>Characters Created: 8,862,354</li><li>Deadliest Dungeon: The Hall of Thanes</li><li>PvP Kills: 9,959,014</li><li>Skyborne: 1,889,084</li><li>Deadliest Creature: Kobold Miner</li><li>Duels Fought: 1,248,125</li><li>Forsaken Paladins: 612,096</li><li>Deaths from Falling: 1,157,204</li><li>Zone with the Most PvP: Hillsbrad Foothills</li></ul><br /><br />Are you ready for WoW: Forever on November 4th? Check out all our guides to prepare.</noscript>            \n        ",
